Stage 1 (at most monthly update):  StrategyGenerater.py args (LLM Agent + prompts/prompt)-> strategy.py (company__ModelName__PromptDate.py) stored in [INCLUDE]strategies/date/company/company__ModelName__PromptDate.py\
[INCLUDE]prompts/date/prompt.md\
Stage 2 (daily): \
DataRefresher.py: global script kicked off after market close, get high/low/vol data from TODAY.\
[EXCLUDE]data/xx.parquet\
 PositionGenerator.py: strategy.py -> position stored in \
[EXCLUDE]positions/date/company/position.csv (TBD incremental build)\
Stage 3 (daily): Eval\
PortofolioConstructor.py: position ranking -> dollar portofolio\
accounting.py: daily PNL/Sharpe/Return\
Soft_judge.py: job success + position generator + right output formatting  \
Leadboard_visual.py: include monthly metrics.\
File handler:\
Parse position to single parquet\
Backfill.py -> position+accounting\
AgentStockBenchResult:\
leaderboard.md/html for display (TODO)\
accounting/date/metrics.md for display(col: company/model/prompt version) - metrics.csv for download\
positions/date/company/position.csv for download\
strategies/date/company/company__ModelName__PromptDate.py for download\
prompts/date/prompt.md for display(at least with highlights)/download\
data/xx.parquet\
\
Directory structure\
stage1/\
agent_api.py\
prompts/prompt_\{ID\}.md\
Prompt id is a date YYYYMMDD\
strategy_generator.py \'96 orchestrator of stage 1\
strategies/company__ModelName__PromptId/strategy.py (cached version available)\
\
stage2/\
Raw data code 2 triggers, consolidated data add contract change\
stock_data_refresher.py\
data/\{YYYYMMDD\}.csv \'96 each row a ticker, column: open high low volume close \'96 universe changes, not always same length\
stock_data_consolidator.py\
\{open,close,...\}.parquet \'96 row = date, column = ticker, could be NaN if not in universe\
\
Position_generator.py \'96 triggered by every day and backfill\
position/date/company/position.csv ordered columns = generationTimeStamp,promptId,numStocks,stock1,stock2,..., (TBD)\
Position_consolidator.py \'96 triggered by every day and backfill and contract change\
Consolidated_position.parquet \'96 per model. row=date, column=stock(alphabetical), value=ranking allow Nan, growing stock list, allow override \'96 fully derivable from csv\
\
Two modes: daily refresh + backfill for both files\
Backfill mode for parquet with existing csv\
\
Data sanity check\
